{"id":"adec8e1737933ff1","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-enumeration-probability.md","title":"集合的枚举概率与通用枚举编号","display":"df-enumeration-probability — 集合的枚举概率与通用枚举编号","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-enumeration-probability","aliases":["43-df-enumeration-probability"],"display":"df-enumeration-probability — 集合的枚举概率与通用枚举编号","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"§11.7, definition preceding Theorem 11.7.1","source_printed_pages":"265","source_pdf_pages":"285","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-enumeration-probability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-enumeration-probability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-enumeration-probability — 集合的枚举概率与通用枚举编号"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.7, definition preceding Theorem 11.7.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"265"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"285"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e^X=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^X)\">\\(W_e^X=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^X)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a> 的同一可接受编号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a> 的公平硬币Borel概率测度。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma X\">\\(\\sigma X\\)</span> 为有限二进制串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 与无限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的连接。等式类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{X:W_e^X=A\\}\">\\(\\{X:W_e^X=A\\}\\)</span> 是Borel集。下式定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_e:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to[0,1]\">\\(P_e:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to[0,1]\\)</span> 及编号谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_e(A):=\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:W_e^X=A\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_e(A):=\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:W_e^X=A\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)\\iff\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;W_e^{\\sigma X}=W_j^X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)\\iff\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;W_e^{\\sigma X}=W_j^X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书固定一个通用编号后把P_e(A)简记为P(A)。此处显式保留编号参数，以供第19章熵引用。每个固定自然数的oracle枚举事件是有效开集，等式类是这些事件及其补集的可数交，故测度确有定义；这不假定A可枚举。通用性是对每个j统一于所有X的前缀模拟。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，§11.7, definition preceding Theorem 11.7.1；印刷页265，PDF页285。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-cylinder]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$；$W_e^X=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^X)$ 采用 [[43-df-ce]] 的同一可接受编号，$\\mu$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率测度。$\\sigma X$ 为有限二进制串 $\\sigma$ 与无限序列 $X$ 的连接。等式类 $\\{X:W_e^X=A\\}$ 是Borel集。下式定义 $P_e:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to[0,1]$ 及编号谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-cylinder","status":"resolved","id":"ab1ef7b1cac112c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$；$W_e^X=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^X)$ 采用 [[43-df-ce]] 的同一可接受编号，$\\mu$ 是 [[43-df-cylinder]] 的公平硬币Borel概率测度。$\\sigma X$ 为有限二进制串 $\\sigma$ 与无限序列 $X$ 的连接。等式类 $\\{X:W_e^X=A\\}$ 是Borel集。下式定义 $P_e:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to[0,1]$ 及编号谓词。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"e\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"W_e^X=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma X","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\{X:W_e^X=A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"P_e:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"P_e(A):=\\mu(\\{X\\in2^\\omega:W_e^X=A\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)\\iff\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;W_e^{\\sigma X}=W_j^X.","display":true}],"bytes":1918,"backlinks":[{"id":"fd664f5e3b6d342a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $e\\in\\mathbb N$ 满足 [[43-df-enumeration-probability]] 的 $\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)$；$P_e(A)$ 见该原子。$W_j$ 采用 [[43-df-ce]] 的同一个标准枚举，$K(j)$ 见 [[43-df-prefixkolm]]。$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 满足 $\\operatorname{CE}(A)$ 且 $P_e(A)>0$；这保证下式两个值均为自然数。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-276","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-enumeration-probability]] — 集合的枚举概率与通用枚举编号"},{"id":"258977a98e69a5c9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$e\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{UniversalEnumerationIndex}(e)$；$P_e$、通用编号谓词和 $\\operatorname{CE}$ 见 [[43-df-enumeration-probability]]、[[43-df-ce]]。"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}